BRINFO
------------

brinfo is a lightweight and simple Brother status monitor tool I
made using C and <a href="http://xforms-toolkit.org/">XForms</a>.
It is designed for UN*X based systems.</p>

It can grab information (e.g. toner levels, drum health) It uses
PJL commands to get this infromation. It has only been tested on the
Brother HL-1110, but should work on other Brother printers in
theory.

MOTIVATION
------------

I found no program that seems to do this and I wanted a new project
to work on :^)

INSTALLATION
------------

Run these commands:

sudo apt-get install build-essential libforms-dev libx11-dev
git clone https://github.com/comdlg32/brinfo
make && sudo make install

You can also get a static binary in GitHub releases on the sidebar
or my webpage:
https://xcomp.coralcmd.net/projects/brinfo/
